  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change Portfolio</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate change portfolio. Funding under this investment aims to enhance resilience of PNG communities and of critical social and economic infrastructure. In support of this goal, this investment will have three main components; small grants for NGOs; capacity development and support; and an adaptation program.


Sector split: General Environmental Protection  100%</narrative>
